                                                   rdfs:label "Act of Artifact Modification"@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Material Artifact Processing in which an existing Material Artifact is acted upon in a manner that changes, adds, or removes one or more of its Qualities, Dispositions, or Functions."@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Excluded from this class are instances of role change or role creation such as the introduction of an artifact as a piece of evidence in a trial or the loading of artifacts onto a ship for transport."@en ;
